div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32105,32207,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32105, 32207, 6)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Shopkeeper</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">March 17, 2000<br/>Beta 5.2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211091428&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dixi_b4686e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Dixi.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>&lt;clears throat&gt; Get your armor and shields heeeeeeere! Upstairs!</li><li>Need some help? Just ask me, I can show you around!</li><li>Don't forget to protect yourself with a shield!</li><li>Selling the finest armors on Rookgaard!</li><li>Don't let these mean monsters hurt you - get better equipment now!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>'s south-east building, upstairs\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Dixi works above her grandfather <a href=\"#/wiki/Obi\">Obi</a>. She buys and sells Armor and Shields. She came to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> to help newcomers with their equipment. Her grandfather won't let her sell weapons because he doesn't like her waving \"pointy things\" around.\n</p><p>Next to Dixi, there are blackboards on which is written the following:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You read: HELMETS:<br/>leather helmet<br/>chain helmet<br/>studded helmet<br/>SHIELDS:<br/>wooden shield<br/>studded shield</span></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You read: ARMORS:<br/>jacket<br/>coat<br/>doublet<br/>leather armor<br/>leather legs</span></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You read: WEAPONS:<br/>spear, dagger<br/>hand axe<br/>axe, rapier<br/>sabre<br/>short sword</span></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You read: GENERAL EQUIPMENT:<br/>rope, torch,<br/>bag, backpack,<br/>scroll, sickle,<br/>shovel, pick, scythe,<br/>fishing rod</span></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Brass Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brass_Helmet_97ebde.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">22 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Brass Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brass_Shield_5d96ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Shield\">Brass Shield</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">25 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><t