ipts, edit the transcripts page for Dixi.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dixi</strong>: Hello, Mam. How may I help you, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>help</b><br/>\nDixi: If you need something, please let me know.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nDixi: I'm helping my grandfather <a href=\"#/wiki/Obi\">Obi</a> with this shop. Do you want to buy or sell anything?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nDixi: I'm Dixi.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sell</b><br/>\nDixi: We're selling many things. Please have a look at the blackboards downstairs to see a list of our inventory.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>weapon</b><br/>\nDixi: We sell spears, rapiers, sabres, daggers, hand axes, axes, and short swords. Just tell me what you want to buy.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>armor</b><br/>\nDixi: We sell jackets, coats, doublets, leather armor, and leather legs. Just tell me what you want to buy.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>helmets</b><br/>\nDixi: We sell leather helmets, studded helmets, and chain helmets. Just tell me what you want to buy.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>equipment</b><br/>\nDixi: We sell torches, bags, scrolls, shovels, picks, backpacks, sickles, scythes, ropes, fishing rods and sixpacks of worms. Just tell me what you want to buy.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nDixi: Good bye, Mam.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nDixi: Hello, Mam. How may I help you, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\nDixi: Good bye.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dixi</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32105,"y":32207,"z":6}}